.env
.env.*
!.env.example
__pycache__/
*.pyc
output/
!output/**/.gitkeep

# Runtime data. Everything under data/ is local state written by the app —
# the Supabase fallback stores for pipeline deals and SMS consent, scraped
# logos, geocode and audience caches. It is customer data, not source, and
# some of it (data/sms) is TCPA consent evidence.
#
# Ignored as a whole rather than dir-by-dir: the previous per-directory list
# covered leads, logos and venue_events, while the code had since started
# writing pipeline/, sms/, inventory/, network_dashboard/,
# venue_audience_profiles/ and venue_geocodes/ — none of them ignored. A
# blanket rule plus .gitkeep un-ignores means a new store is covered the day
# it is added.
data/*
!data/**/.gitkeep

# Checked-in reference data, not runtime state: the venue roster, the
# hand-curated audience multipliers and the geocode cache are inputs the app
# ships with. Named explicitly so the blanket rule above cannot quietly drop
# an update to them.
!data/network_dashboard.json
!data/venue_audience_profiles.json
!data/venue_geocodes.json

config/qb_tokens.json
.claude/
TRADE_SECRETS.md
docs/NTV360_BUSINESS_CASE.md
assets/samples/*.docx
